  "system": {
    "slug": "grunt",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 9
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Grunt is a tank-bred krogan — genetically perfected for war from the moment of his creation by the Warlord Okeer. He was born knowing how to fight, carrying the genetic memories of a thousand krogan warriors. He is everything a krogan is supposed to be: massive, unstoppable, enthusiastic about violence, and loyal to Shepard in his own way.</p><p><strong>Krogan Regeneration:</strong> Grunt recovers 15 HP at the start of each of his turns.</p><p><strong>Berserker Charge (2 actions, 1/encounter):</strong> Grunt charges up to 40 feet in a straight line and makes a melee Strike (+26, 2d8+11 bludgeoning) at the end. On a hit, the target is knocked Prone and pushed 10 feet.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
      "publication": {
